const seed:Catalog={name:'Mi Catálogo',description:'Productos seleccionados para vos',whatsapp:'',logo:'',cover:'',theme:'classic',currency:'$',accent:'#8b5cf6',font:'system',shape:'soft',coverShape:'round',productShape:'soft',titleSize:38,descriptionSize:16,categories:[{id:'c1',name:'Destacados',emoji:'✨'}],products:[]};
